<p><br />&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: left;"&gt;Jako część nadawcza służy chiński moduł DRA818 : <a href="https://www.dorji.com/docs/data/DRA818V.pdf">https://www.dorji.com/docs/data/DRA818V.pdf</a>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<img alt="" data-original-height="360" data-original-width="530" height="217" src="/images/AVvXsEhPSqlSUGk7iSOPKgssjtzEdecyYlnIzx0FKmZS4ntUBAfrHkXecG_gkrjhl9JTIDskFB5Ztc1JZaAEbp_vSL7XsXchvl9_Bmbi28R8M1pinXnJC4cSW3bvQtV95RrwxdeA__piR08GdIzmVewkPxEe-6B2ijd_FFtrc6yl92ci0NAtrtv0fEaWtoWYCf3I=w320-h217" width="320" />&lt;/div&gt;<br /><br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: left;"&gt;Oprócz instalacji systemu potrzebujemy jeszcze pakiet imagemagick oraz pysstv.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br /> Także z poprzedniego projektu miałem już przygotowane PCB, cześć radiowa to typowa implementacja DRA818. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jako źródła obrazu użyłem prostej kamerki internetowej podłączonej do portu USB, jest w planie wymnienić ją na kamerę wintegrowaną przez GPIO.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Musimy także zdefiniowac pin który posłuży jako PTT , niezbędna pomoc znajduje się tutuaj : &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;https://wiki.friendlyelec.com/wiki/index.php/WiringNP:_NanoPi_NEO/NEO2/Air_GPIO_Programming_with_C&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instalacja obsługi IO:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class="de1" style="background: none rgb(249, 249, 249); border: 0px none white; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-feature-settings: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-size-adjust: none; font-size: 14px; font-stretch: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: top;"&gt;<span class="kw2" style="color: #c20cb9; font-weight: bold;">git clone</span> https:<span class="sy0" style="font-weight: bold;">//</span>github.com<span class="sy0" style="font-weight: bold;">/</span>friendlyarm<span class="sy0" style="font-weight: bold;">/</span>WiringNP
<span class="kw3" style="color: #7a0874; font-weight: bold;">cd</span> WiringNP<span class="sy0" style="font-weight: bold;">/</span>
<span class="kw2" style="color: #c20cb9; font-weight: bold;">chmod</span> <span class="nu0">755</span> build
.<span class="sy0" style="font-weight: bold;">/</span>build&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Poniżej skrypt roibiący całą “magię” :&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="text-align: left;"&gt;<span style="font-family: courier;">#!/bin/bash<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">echo “robie fote”<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">fswebcam -r 640x480 –no-banner –no-subtitle 640x480.png<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">echo “zmiana rozdzielczosci”<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">convert 640x480.png -resize 640x496! nowy.png<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">echo “dodaje napisy”<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">convert nowy.png -font helvetica -pointsize 80 -fill red -draw “text 20,70 ‘SP7HACK’” -pointsize 40 -draw “text 20,110 ‘JO91RS’” -pointsize 30 -draw “text 20,145 ‘$(date)’” -pointsize 30 -draw “text 20,470 ‘Zapraszamy do Hakierspejs Łódź hs-ldz.pl’” hack.png<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">echo “generuje SSTV”<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">python3 -m pysstv –mode PD120 –vox –fskid SP7HACK hack.png sp7hack.wav<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">echo “Ustawiam radio na 433.4”<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">/bin/echo -n -e “AT+DMOSETGROUP=1,433.4000,433.4000,0000,5,0000\n\r” &gt; /dev/ttyS1<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">echo “PTT ON”<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">/usr/local/bin/gpio mode 4 out<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">/usr/local/bin/gpio write 4 0<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">sleep 1<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">echo “Leci SSTV”<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">AUDIODEV=hw:2 play sp7hack.wav<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">echo “PTT OFF”<br /></span><span style="font-family: courier;">/usr/local/bin/gpio write 4 1</span>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Całość może posłużyć np. jako payload w misji balonowej.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<br />&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;<br />&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<img alt="" data-original-height="573" data-original-width="1280" height="286" src="/images/AVvXsEg8VOF7l5KNP2eS7YW_WYGO3W7EJ5AC3kqzdaFj_kP7ohe3zYDlPnDsEUJjArxieMBa9YrXTqlO6bZkQg5NfNZgRF1buU_HVtpi7xfWq9vW9OBajBcCsCdW1I9ctTO3Pd4evqSEmfbD6-6oPpJ_rx5iMRxM2aCYznSrGWBOGgpkF5c-rvf_I0mRrgbvzQyr=w640-h286" width="640" />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<img alt="" data-original-height="573" data-original-width="1280" height="286" src="/images/AVvXsEj2uP2ndMXz9z5ysIby1iYcZKGwLT-tO4gzVlqTzG5ZqjSlPAjhXdvKamL5kDQC7L02D5f3rCek2d0bv-NZ18CoAxXp6B45DVIIZnAkTl-w1LYZAczIcglvryuCDctXd6XSJjGN345CBQTwDKGEAoO2pYdYBQQJN06e_iCbmgHyl-vQBO5GrsnfPkVsZGqp=w640-h286" width="640" />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: left;"&gt;Będąc u nas w Hakierspejs możesz ustawićradio na 433.400 i odebrać obrazki prostym radiotelefonem i aplikacją na telefon np : Robot36 - poniżej kilka odebranych obrazków.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: left;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: left;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<img alt="" data-original-height="496" data-original-width="640" height="495" src="/images/AVvXsEgeoOCboeMjLMgdU_vVHdhNnZmIj0T5rY6O9oJun-C1OPdavtPgFRBYiXRLi2tqlZYQ_R2KfX1GJC6Asks3HEE0va4cGZ8njEYJSmO8HY-gGKk6fc4WcURKgIXUBEWoKgWUT24gQ3NTLjjSKvZNwTatNqSVjcTqOQqN1A46-89iQ7VOEZHsWLcdtpNrQ_9y=w640-h495" width="640" />&lt;/div&gt;<br /><br />&lt;/div&gt;<br />&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<img alt="" data-original-height="496" data-original-width="640" height="480" src="/images/AVvXsEjKuJZVFcx42dfmxld_broPzDPGdg66pp6jx5kJCztuFHUrXovTTx3R3dMUGHvv-D9Zikl_Hu1BKnX5MJSonfkxjCA08w0ik_A4zkrbsvlLeuZGEf0GF4DnsgxYU_NFHX1J74OdlAO-qwO1j0U_3uzZNC1JnQlOMzCWQkaMtwiQ2gZUc8PIRU8dI84XA4Pm" width="619" />&lt;/div&gt;<br /><br />&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"&gt;<img alt="" data-original-height="496" data-original-width="640" height="480" src="/images/AVvXsEjWD-SwTuJcd17FEZcqIDutrzf0qh7hkaEU8iVPmN9cTXbwtUvb1gABlfsjIkkB4ClCyaApOrrY-etlQ0u_t1PBIzhbL0e3o2GDOvKZZrChZgCsz9pOQtpdA0h_P9baXqcNotjcP3kF8tIlUBJ6edo8GV53NskAcf1F8BdUD-Y9_0FCbq_f5-Ve_GO11Rw9" width="619" />&lt;/div&gt;<br /><br /><br />&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</p>
